"Higher rates reduce click and movement latency, at the cost of slightly higher battery use." = "更高的轮询率可降低点击与光标延迟，代价是电池消耗略增。";
"Bluetooth is capped at ~125 Hz on macOS. Connect via the 2.4 GHz dongle for 500 or 1000 Hz." = "蓝牙下 macOS 会将轮询率限制在约 125 Hz。要用 500 或 1000 Hz 请接入 2.4 GHz 接收器。";

/* ─── Low-battery notification (multi-drop copy) ──────────────── */
"Sends a macOS notification when battery crosses the threshold, and again on each further drop." = "首次跌破阈值时发送 macOS 通知；之后每再往下跌都会重新通知。";

/* ─── Utilities pane ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
"Debug logging" = "调试日志";
"Records every button press, scroll tick, and Bluetooth state change to the log. Only enable while investigating a specific issue — the log grows fast." = "把每一次按键、滚动和蓝牙状态变化都写入日志。仅在排查具体问题时开启，日志会增长得很快。";
"Overridden by the BSKV3XHS_DEBUG environment variable this session." = "本次会话由 BSKV3XHS_DEBUG 环境变量覆盖。";
"Clear log" = "清空日志";
"Wipe /tmp/bskv3xhs.log so the next repro starts fresh." = "清空 /tmp/bskv3xhs.log，让下一次复现从空白开始。";

